## Current State (2026-04-28)

### What works
- JobMonitorRunner uses DI (IAzureDevOpsService, IHelixService) with fakes for testing
- 16 scenario tests all pass (47 total in suite)
- Retry resubmission: on attempt > 1, failed work items are resubmitted as new Helix jobs
- Per-work-item outcome tracking (resubmission pass overwrites prior failure)
- Stage-scoped monitoring (monitorAllStages=false filters by stage)
- Pipeline template: HJM runs inside Test stage, uses ./eng/common/dotnet.sh exec

### What needs work
- HelixService.ResubmitFailedWorkItemsAsync is a stub (throws NotImplementedException)
  - Needs real Helix API implementation: get original job details, create new job with same
    correlation payloads/queue but only failed work items, preserve BuildId/StageName properties
- The monitor timeout + relaunch tests work but the non-PR source query still doesn't find
  Helix jobs in manual builds (official/public/... pattern doesn't match)
- Consider adding tests for:
  - Retry-of-retry (attempt 3 after attempt 2 resubmission also failed)
  - Work item name collisions across different Helix jobs
  - Partial upload failure during result processing
  - Resubmission when monitor crashes mid-resubmission and restarts

### Test infrastructure
- Fakes auto-advance per API call (no coupled snapshot advancement)
- FakeAzureDevOpsService.TimelineCallCount tracks poll iterations
- FakeHelixService.Resubmissions tracks resubmission calls for assertions
- FakeHelixService.ConfigureResubmission(originalJob, newJobName) sets up resubmission results
- CreateRunner(azdo, helix, stageName, attempt) helper in tests

### File layout
- JobMonitor/Interfaces/ - IAzureDevOpsService, IHelixService, IJobMonitorRunner
- JobMonitor/Models/ - HelixJobInfo, HelixJobPassFail, WorkItemTestResults
- JobMonitor/Services/ - AzureDevOpsService, HelixService (real implementations)
- Sdk.Tests/Fakes/ - FakeAzureDevOpsService, FakeHelixService
- Sdk.Tests/ScenarioHelpers/ - factory methods for timeline/helix test data
- Sdk.Tests/JobMonitorRunnerTests.cs - all scenario tests
